#X text 20 20 The only thing in Cut It that sends to these LEDs: one SysEx per repaint \, the header \, 108 specs and 247. A spec is type 0 \, the index and a palette color \, or type 3 \, the index and red \, green and blue: 332 bytes when every cell is a palette color \, two more for each RGB one., f 58;
#X text 20 140 The span is 1 to 108 \, every button that takes a color: LED state survives the mode switch \, so an index outside the span could never be cleared. Index 0 \, Setup \, lights nothing (items 105 \, 109 and 110 \, on the Launchpad's Reference page)., f 90;
