#X text 2150 1100 inlet 2 is c_steps' drum page \, meaning and never a cell: steps <32 levels> \, play <step> \, vel <level> \, track <pad> \, last <step> \, bar <N> <row> \, rep <pad> \, fast and recall <1 or 0> and quiet <16 flags> (ref/module/display.md). Each sets dirty and goes to g_grid-lua \, which keeps the page and paints it on page 2 when pd regions sends paint: g_grid.lua works out each cell of cut-it-drum-page.txt \, which u_map reads too \, so a press and its lamp cannot disagree. Anything else is fail g_grid bad-selector. At load the Lua answers init with a bang \, which shuts the spigot: no bang means it never loaded \, and fail g_grid no-lua says so. The drum page is dark then \, and everything else g_grid draws is Pd and still works. C-5, f 58;
