#X text 2700 1380 inlet 3 is c_synth's choice \, synth fm or synth strings \, as 1 or 2 \, and sets dirty: page 3 paints the chosen synth's pads bright and the other's dim. Anything else is bad-selector \, as on inlet 2., f 40;
